# Production environment variables for Electron build
# Vite loads this file automatically for `npm run build` (production builds)
#
# For Electron, the frontend loads via file:// protocol so relative API paths
# resolve to file:///api/... which fails. We need an absolute URL to the backend.
#
# Replace with your deployed backend URL (e.g., https://sentinel-backend.onrender.com)

